; BOOTUP.BIN: Ultima III (Origin 1983, PC version by James R. Van Artsdalen).
; Generated by tools/gen.py; tools/build.py builds it (MASM, LINK, then the image from 0100).
; ORGANIZE: the party menu: look, form, disperse (14C9-194B).
;
; Overview: RunOrganizeMenu is the "Party Organization" menu: Examine the Register,
; Create a Character, Terminate a Character (CREATE.ASM), Form the Party (FormParty),
; Disperse the Party (DisperseParty), Look at a Character (LookAtChar), Main Menu. The party
; lives in PartyBuf (PARTY.ULT: an 18-byte header, then four 64-byte records, PartyChars); its
; header holds the party size (PartySize) and the roster numbers (1-20) of the members (PartyRosterNums).
; A roster record (Roster, ROSTER.ULT, 20 x 40h) whose +10h flag is 0FFh is in the party;
; while the party exists its up-to-date copy is the party record, written back at Disperse.
; Forming and dispersing save both files.
CODE SEGMENT BYTE PUBLIC
ASSUME CS:CODE, DS:CODE, ES:CODE, SS:CODE
EXTRN PrintStr:NEAR
EXTRN SwapCursor:NEAR
EXTRN PutChar:NEAR
EXTRN PrintBcdWord:NEAR
EXTRN PrintBcdByte:NEAR
EXTRN PrintDigit:NEAR
EXTRN AskChoice:NEAR
EXTRN SaveFile:NEAR
EXTRN PrintAt:NEAR
EXTRN PartyBuf:BYTE
EXTRN Location:BYTE
EXTRN PartySize:BYTE
EXTRN PartyX:BYTE
EXTRN PartyY:BYTE
EXTRN PartyRosterNums:BYTE
EXTRN PartyChars:BYTE
EXTRN Roster:BYTE
EXTRN FileRosterUlt:BYTE
EXTRN FilePartyUlt:BYTE
